      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 60 Monastery Walk to the market, an impressive detached home ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac within this mature and highly regarded residential development. Monastery Walk is ideally located with a host of local amenities close by. Clondalkin Village, schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities are all within easy reach, while excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The N7, M50 and Red Cow LUAS are also readily accessible, making this an ideal location for both commuters and families alike. Extending to approximately 137 sq. m., this substantial property offers generous and versatile accommodation throughout and benefits from a large private rear garden together with a significant extension to the rear. The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious living/reception accommodation, kitchen/dining facilities and bathroom accommodation at ground floor level, with four bedrooms and further bathroom upstairs. The substantial rear extension provides additional living space and adds considerably to the overall footprint of the property. Externally, one of the property's standout features is the large and private rear garden whilst to the front there is a generous driveway providing off-street parking. Properties of this size and type are rarely available to the market. No. 60 offers an exciting opportunity for a purchaser to acquire a sizeable home with excellent scope to configure to their own needs.\r\nKey Features\r\nBer C\r\nc.137 sqm\r\n4 bed, 2 bath\r\nHighly sought after development\r\nLarge, private rear garden\r\nMature settings\r\nExtended to rear\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nFantastic opportunity\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom the N7, take the exit for Clondalkin and follow signs toward Clondalkin Village. Continue straight ahead and proceed through the main village area. After passing through the village, follow the road toward Monastery Road and take the turn for Monastery Walk. Continue along Monastery Walk and No. 10 will be located on the corner, clearly positioned within the development"
      },
